# SIA container build context = the SecurityInsight solution root (the Dockerfile needs
# analyzer-web/src + analyzer/seed). The image must contain ONLY those. Exclude EVERYTHING
# else from the ACR build upload — in particular NEVER upload customer config to the build
# service: *.custom.* / config/ / DATA/ / demo/ stay out.
*
!analyzer-web
!analyzer
analyzer/*
!analyzer/seed
# never ship build artifacts or any customer/runtime config even from the included trees
analyzer-web/**/bin
analyzer-web/**/obj
**/*.custom.ps1
**/*.custom.json
**/*.custom.csv
**/*.custom.yaml
**/config/
**/DATA/
